00:00:00.422 --> 00:00:04.295
Unit one. Using Software and Apps!

2
00:00:05.254 --> 00:00:10.563
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:10.613 --> 00:00:14.550
