4
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:19.252
Today we learn about Using Software and Apps. Let's go!

5
00:00:20.108 --> 00:00:24.341
Software. Say it with me. Software!

6
00:00:27.866 --> 00:00:32.533
Application. Say it with me. Application!

7
00:00:36.020 --> 00:00:40.387
Install. Say it with me. Install!

8
00:00:43.902 --> 00:00:47.835
Update. Say it with me. Update!

9
00:00:51.335 --> 00:00:55.501
Icon. Say it with me. Icon!

10
00:00:59.005 --> 00:01:02.605
Menu. Say it with me. Menu!

11
00:01:06.073 --> 00:01:10.073
Toolbar. Say it with me. Toolbar!

12
00:01:13.603 --> 00:01:17.586
Close. Say it with me. Close!

13
00:01:21.007 --> 00:01:36.502
Software includes every application I use on a computer or tablet. I install a new app and keep it updated so it works well. Clicking an icon opens the app, and the menu or toolbar helps me find tools before I close it.

14
00:01:36.552 --> 00:01:39.687
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:40.435 --> 00:01:45.795
